{"items":[{"id":"1374108472783450112","title":"给大家说个大宗商品涨价的表象吧","content":"<p>给大家说个大宗商品涨价的表象吧。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5月3日拉进一批钢材，5月4日一吨涨了150元。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;关键是，感觉一时半会还停不住。</p>","excerpt":"给大家说个大宗商品涨价的表象吧","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":8,"created":1620392989,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1374108472783450112"},{"id":"1373721777080856576","title":"忽然发现，好像这些也没有什么意思","content":"<p>忽然发现，好像这些也没有什么意思。</p>","excerpt":"忽然发现，好像这些也没有什么意思","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":9,"created":1620300794,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1373721777080856576"},{"id":"1373357652437856256","title":"美国 ","content":"<p>美国💊</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e3fc6674477e76c3995a46f6632b350d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1416\">","excerpt":"美国","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":18,"created":1620213980,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1373357652437856256"},{"id":"1372654796260982784","title":"拒绝以下小道消息，一切以统计结果为准...","content":"<p>拒绝以下小道消息，一切以统计结果为准...</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-e66d63906572f51607a309ff0552854f_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"727\">","excerpt":"拒绝以下小道消息，一切以统计结果为准...","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":41,"created":1620046406,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1372654796260982784"},{"id":"1371783360839380992","title":"土地集中供给的时候我就说了这波是肯定会…","content":"<p>土地集中供给的时候我就说了这波是肯定会拉高土拍价格的，当时评论区对我一顿嘲讽，觉得我咋也不懂。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;看了最近部分省份公布50%溢价率土拍价格.....我就不说啥了吧。</p>","excerpt":"土地集中供给的时候我就说了这波是肯定会…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":21,"created":1619838639,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1371783360839380992"},{"id":"1371031304709054464","title":"剪辑视频，不行","content":"<p>剪辑视频，不行。&lt;br&gt;阴阳合同，可以。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;百姓探富，不行。&lt;br&gt;亿万片酬，可以。</p>","excerpt":"剪辑视频，不行","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":20,"created":1619659335,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1371031304709054464"},{"id":"1370736494907355136","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-51cec8481fc7b7eb82250e5fbcd89b5e_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"606\" height=\"800\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":10,"created":1619589047,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1370736494907355136"},{"id":"1370484915541266432","title":"英国金融时报发布了一篇文章，大意就是我…","content":"<p>英国金融时报发布了一篇文章，大意就是我国人口普查出现自1949年的首次下降。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;看大家有兴趣没有，如果感兴趣的人多，我给大家翻译翻译。</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-410a7a6e2a8c2b354c521dd7636cbb37_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"626\" height=\"521\">","excerpt":"英国金融时报发布了一篇文章，大意就是我…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":33,"created":1619529066,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1370484915541266432"},{"id":"1370159902145462272","title":".....","content":"<p>.....</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-13a4d70f5845236c3815119732805b96_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2340\">","excerpt":".....","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":14,"created":1619451577,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1370159902145462272"},{"id":"1369598695500017664","title":"35岁以上你连刚需都不是","content":"<p>35岁以上你连刚需都不是。.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;这意味着啥.....年龄大了别说考不了体制，进不了好单位，想买房都不让你买。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;那么问题来了，正常年轻人不靠父母能在35岁前凑齐买房的钱嘛？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;这是鼓励刚需，还是提倡啃老，还是确保30年房贷能够稳稳落实不出现系统性风险？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我也不知道啊。</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-271e622111b8ce3c40dca5031ea1dfef_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"586\">","excerpt":"35岁以上你连刚需都不是","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":21,"created":1619317774,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1369598695500017664"}]}